  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"此模組已納入Wishful Recipes的一部分。請點擊此處查看。它能自動動態生成配方，因此與其他模組高度相容，且較少需要額外設定。\"></a></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>本模組的功能已整合至<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">高爐熔煉所有石頭方塊</a></span></span></strong></span></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1v9T1K.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmars_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 ko-fi 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-netherrack-into-nether-bricks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/959229?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblasting-netherrack-into-nether-bricks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/blasting-netherrack-into-nether-bricks?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>此模組讓你能在高爐中以兩倍速度將地獄岩熔煉成地獄磚頭。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PvwfdMc.png\" width=\"366\" height=\"274\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmars-the-planet.github.io%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/a1a13adf-7c67-48f1-8d6e-e08334434df1.png\"></a></p>",
